OL,3,AMurder arrests after fire kills two
OL,4,Aincluding child
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after two died in a
OL,8,Fhouse fire including a child, police
OL,9,Fhave confirmed.
OL,11,FThe blaze in Grangetown, Middlesbrough,
OL,12,Fbroke out just before 05:30 BST and
OL,13,Falso left a 48-year-old woman in
OL,14,Fhospital in a critical condition,
OL,15,Falongside a further three people who
OL,16,Fsuffered non-life threatening injuries.
OL,18,FCleveland Police said the two victims
OL,19,Fwere yet to be formally identified.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
